          "id": "ask_status_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "大丈夫だよ。少し考えごとしてた、かも。",
          "displayText": "I'm okay. A little thoughtful, maybe.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "ask_status_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_status_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "でも、そうやって聞いてくれると助かるの。部屋が少し、静かすぎなくなるから。",
          "displayText": "It helps when you ask, though. It makes the room feel less quiet.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
